<p><strong class="FuturisMarkdown-Strong">В. Функцию <code class="CodeInlined">renderCases</code> замени целиком:</strong></p>
<pre class="FuturisMarkdown-Pre"><div data-testid="codeblock" class="CodeBlock CodeBlock_overflow_visible CodeBlock_highlight"><div class="CodeBlock-StickyWrapper"><div class="CodeBlock-Header" data-testid="codeblock-header"><div class="CodeBlock-HeaderTitle" data-testid="codeblock-language">javascript</div><div class="CodeBlock-HeaderActions"><button type="button" class="Button Button_view_blankPrimary Button_size_m CodeBlock-HeaderAction CodeBlock-HeaderAction_text" autocomplete="off" data-testid="codeblock-action-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12.187 7.35c2.489 0 3.878 2.875 2.33 4.825a2.977 2.977 0 0 1-2.33 1.126H11.16l.781.722-.441.478-.441.476-2.479-2.292 2.444-2.627.476.443.476.442-.984 1.058h1.194c.511 0 .995-.234 1.313-.634.844-1.063.136-2.616-1.183-2.713l-.13-.004H1v-1.3h11.187ZM7 13.3H1v-1.299h6v1.3Zm8-9.299H1V2.699h14v1.302Z"></path></svg><span class="Button-Text">Переносить</span></button><button type="button" class="Button Button_view_blankPrimary Button_size_m CodeBlock-HeaderAction CodeBlock-HeaderAction_text" autocomplete="off" data-testid="codeblock-action-collapse"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor"><path d="M7.15 15h-1.3v-3.93l-3.54 3.54-.92-.92 3.54-3.54H1v-1.3h6.15V15Zm3-10.07 3.74-3.74.46.46.46.46-3.74 3.74H15v1.3H8.85V1h1.3v3.93Z"></path></svg><span class="Button-Text">Свернуть</span></button><button type="button" class="Button Button_view_blankPrimary Button_size_m CodeBlock-HeaderAction CodeBlock-HeaderAction_text" autocomplete="off" data-testid="codeblock-action-copy"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor"><path d="M10.4.5c1.963 0 2.946 0 3.667.442a3 3 0 0 1 .99.99c.443.722.443 1.704.443 3.668v.8l-.007 1.301c-.02 1.139-.104 1.826-.435 2.367l-.097.149c-.236.338-.54.625-.894.842l-.138.078c-.52.267-1.186.338-2.229.357l-.206.00